  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1731bbcd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### GELU\n",
    "\n",
    "Smooth activation used in many Transformer architectures, including language models."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f24db9c5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import math\n",
    "\n",
    "def gelu(x):\n",
    "    return 0.5*x*(1+math.tanh(math.sqrt(2/math.pi)*(x+0.044715*x**3)))\n",
    "\n",
    "print('GELU(1) =', round(gelu(1), 5))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d6d7931c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Matplotlib visualization:**"
